{"id":"wb-6-323","name":"天宫寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"天宫寺塔","text":"天宫寺塔，位于中华人民共和国河北省唐山市丰润区，是一座密檐式砖石佛塔。该塔始建于辽代，原为天宫寺的附属建筑，后寺庙被毁，仅余该塔。天宫寺塔在唐山大地震中遭到严重破坏，甚至一度被降格为县级文物保护单位。20世纪80年代，维修人员在重修该塔的过程中发现了两处塔室，并从中发掘出了大量文物。2006年，天宫寺塔被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E5%AE%AB%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":90816170,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90816170","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a15d8329f30ed4d61564ffc1.jpg","title":"天宫寺塔_正面.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A9%E5%AE%AB%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94_%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/%E5%A4%A9%E5%AE%AB%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94_%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"維基小霸王","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​河北唐山丰润天宫寺塔","width":320,"height":480}}